DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
13311::$$$message_0108_0000_0000$$$::"...I was looking at the sea."[lr]::
13312::$$$message_0108_0000_0001$$$::Saber says, as she looks back.[lr]::
13313::$$$message_0108_0000_0002$$$::...There's nothing else to see.[lr]::
13314::$$$message_0108_0000_0003$$$::I came here on a whim, and the first person who I found was Saber.::
13315::$$$message_0108_0001_0000$$$::A white blouse and an ultramarine blue skirt, her shining golden hair.[lr]::
13316::$$$message_0108_0001_0001$$$::I could tell that it was Saber right away even from afar.[lr]::
13317::$$$message_0108_0001_0002$$$::Yet, I didn't call to her for a while even as I came close to her.::
13318::$$$message_0108_0002_0000$$$::This must not be her first time seeing the ocean.[lr]::
13319::$$$message_0108_0002_0001$$$::She's staring too far into the distance, [se volume=50 storage=se545.wav]so I can't help but think that.[lr]::
13320::$$$message_0108_0002_0002$$$::How stupid. Saber's hometown should be by the seaside.[se volume=75 storage=se545.wav]::
13321::$$$message_0108_0003_0000$$$::"The ocean sure is calm here in this country, Shirou."[lr]::
13322::$$$message_0108_0003_0001$$$::"Huh...? Yeah, this is the inland sea. There's more rough waves if you go farther out."[lr]::
13323::$$$message_0108_0003_0002$$$::It would be grand if the waves surged on the cape like the Black Current of the Pacific Coast or the rough waves of the Sea of Japan.[lr]::
13324::$$$message_0108_0003_0003$$$::Taking Saber to a place like that sounds like a dream.::
13325::$$$message_0108_0004_0000$$$::"The sea of my hometown was like a thousand white horses were running while bristling up their manes when the wind made the waves turbulent.[lr]::
13326::$$$message_0108_0004_0001$$$::Or if you looked at land in the distance from above the white cape, you could see the opposite shore extend beyond the sea fog."[lr]::
13327::$$$message_0108_0004_0002$$$::Even though it's a calm sea of a warm autumn day, I can picture that scenery when Saber describes it.[se volume=60 storage=se608.wav][lr]::
13328::$$$message_0108_0004_0003$$$::A more harsh and solemn scenery that isn't similar and can't be seen from the ocean now.::
13329::$$$message_0108_0005_0000$$$::...I glance at Saber's side profile.[lr]::
13330::$$$message_0108_0005_0001$$$::When she's talking about her hometown, it feels somewhat painful.[lr]::
13331::$$$message_0108_0005_0002$$$::"If peace ever came to my country, I wanted to go on a boat and see the land of another country.[lr]::
13332::$$$message_0108_0005_0003$$$::The golden plains of Gaul that the knights from the continent talk about, and the green hills of Hibernia where the people of Erin live. [lr]::
13333::$$$message_0108_0005_0004$$$::Or I wanted to fly my flag and see unknown cultural relics with my own eyes on the distant land interwoven in the songs that the minstrels sang."::
13334::$$$message_0108_0006_0000$$$::...I have no words to respond with. [lr]::
13335::$$$message_0108_0006_0001$$$::Discussing an ending that couldn't be fulfilled is not my job right now.::
13336::$$$message_0108_0007_0000$$$::"...I could not help but recall those kinds of things.[lr]::
13337::$$$message_0108_0007_0001$$$::I am blessed. I wonder what kind of miracle happened[wvl][se volume=70 storage=se545.wav][line len=3]that allowed me to overlook this view not with regret, but as a good memory.[lr]::
13338::$$$message_0108_0007_0002$$$::I think of my former country and am connecting my memories to your country even now."::
13339::$$$message_0108_0008_0000$$$::Saber turns around.[lr]::
13340::$$$message_0108_0008_0001$$$::The sea breeze flows through her arms, as if to bless her.::
13341::$$$message_0108_0009_0000$$$::"This land is nice, enveloping me with warmth. They do say home is where you make it.[lr]::
13342::$$$message_0108_0009_0001$$$::I would like to show you my hometown some day.[lr]::
13343::$$$message_0108_0009_0002$$$::Even if the times change, I like to believe that the sign of the times that we lived through is left in those green hills."::
13344::$$$message_0108_0010_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
13345::$$$message_0108_0010_0001$$$::A hope similar to envy.[lr]::
13346::$$$message_0108_0010_0002$$$::There's no words for me to say as usual.::
13347::$$$message_0108_0011_0000$$$::"Shirou? What is wrong? You look like you are having a hard time.[lr]::
13348::$$$message_0108_0011_0001$$$::...Did I say something to trouble you?"[lr]::
13349::$$$message_0108_0011_0002$$$::"That's not it[line len=3]it's just your first time talking about your hometown like that."[lr]::
13350::$$$message_0108_0011_0003$$$::The hometown that Saber talks about is scented like illusions and grass.[lr]::
13351::$$$message_0108_0011_0004$$$::I think hard about what kind of scent Fuyuki would give off when talking about it in another country as an example.::
13352::$$$message_0108_0012_0000$$$::"Isn't a hometown[line len=3]something you should reminisce about from afar?"[lr]::
13353::$$$message_0108_0012_0001$$$::"I don't know whose poem that is from, but I understand that nostalgia.[lr]::
13354::$$$message_0108_0012_0002$$$::No one would know where they were until they distance themselves."[lr]::
13355::$$$message_0108_0012_0003$$$::"Oh...that is..."[lr]::
13356::$$$message_0108_0012_0004$$$::I feel like I've heard something similar before.[lr]::
13357::$$$message_0108_0012_0005$$$::When you break something that you don't feel that attached to.[lr]::
13358::$$$message_0108_0012_0006$$$::You realize that something was important in exchange for mourning something that won't come back.::
13359::$$$message_0108_0013_0000$$$::"...You don't know until you distance yourself, huh?[lr]::
13360::$$$message_0108_0013_0001$$$::But, how do I say this... It's too natural to live in this town after being raised here.[lr]::
13361::$$$message_0108_0013_0002$$$::I feel like I would want to come back here eventually even if I go somewhere far away."::
13362::$$$message_0108_0014_0000$$$::"Yes. I feel your way of living from those words.[lr]::
13363::$$$message_0108_0014_0001$$$::Even while thinking of your hometown in another country, your heart is always in this town. That is correct. A hometown is something like that to anyone."::
13364::$$$message_0108_0015_0000$$$::I nod to Saber's words.[lr]::
13365::$$$message_0108_0015_0001$$$::There's no one who wouldn't love the land that they grew up in.[lr]::
13366::$$$message_0108_0015_0002$$$::Even if they don't have any clear feelings of affection, that is a homing instinct that is incorporated with an unconscious foundation that's hard to go against.[lr]::
13367::$$$message_0108_0015_0003$$$::Yet...::
13368::$$$message_0108_0016_0000$$$::Even so...[lr]::
13369::$$$message_0108_0016_0001$$$::There are some unique souls who hate their hometowns so much that they want to leave.::
13370::$$$message_0108_0017_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
13371::$$$message_0108_0017_0001$$$::It might be because of the strong sunlight.[lr]::
13372::$$$message_0108_0017_0002$$$::I feel like I'm getting a bit dizzy.[lr]::
13373::$$$message_0108_0017_0003$$$::Since Saber was at the port for once, I got caught in my thoughts thinking of something out of character for me like about my hometown.[lr]::
13374::$$$message_0108_0017_0004$$$::All right, for a change of pace...::
13375::$$$message_0108_0018_0000$$$::"Oh yeah. You like fish right, Saber?"[lr]::
13376::$$$message_0108_0018_0001$$$::"Yes, I do like them if you disregard specific ones... [cacheimage storage=セイバー私服12g(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=400][chgfg time=200 storage=セイバー私服12g(中)]Could there be a fish market here, Shirou?"[lr]::
13377::$$$message_0108_0018_0002$$$::"No, there isn't. Oh, but autumn fish sounds good too, like yuzu on saury."[lr]::
13378::$$$message_0108_0018_0003$$$::"That is the essence of Japan... Yes."::
13379::$$$message_0108_0019_0000$$$::Thus, tonight's menu was decided.[lr]::
13380::$$$message_0108_0019_0001$$$::It would be good if there were some that were fatty, but well, any fish during this season would be good no matter what.[lr]::
13381::$$$message_0108_0019_0002$$$::And bringing out the flavor is up to the skill of the chef.[lr]::
13382::$$$message_0108_0019_0003$$$::...However, it's only in times like this that there's no one fishing all day.::
13383::$$$message_0108_0020_0000$$$::"I'm looking forward to it, Shirou."[lr]::
13384::$$$message_0108_0020_0001$$$::"Yeah, I'll do my best[line len=3]do you have somewhere you need to go?"[lr]::
13385::$$$message_0108_0020_0002$$$::"No, not particularly. Let us go back soon, Shirou."::
13386::$$$message_0108_0021_0000$$$::I leave the port, [se storage=se545.wav]being urged by Saber.[lr]::
13387::$$$message_0108_0021_0001$$$::The sea breeze pushes my back.[lr]::
13388::$$$message_0108_0021_0002$$$::[line len=3]The horizon in the distance.[lr]::
13389::$$$message_0108_0021_0003$$$::I wonder if the wind that blows from a distant foreign country crosses this country and eventually goes back to its hometown.::
913342::$$$message_9108_0009_0001$$$::"I would like to show you my hometown some day."[r]::

